"She loses an eye to the thing in the sea during the tutorial, and it later regrows paler."
"A human traps her with flashbangs and lures her into the sleepshroom's ground, nearly killing both."
"She returns to Earth at five tons, twice her old size, and wishes to be called Lurk."
"Her grown hide is gray-green, with fur left only as a mane, a back ridge and tufts."
"A great scar crosses her face."
"She grasps more words as her Mind rises and at last says her first word, Go."
"She hardens her skin with stamina before impact and flings boulders with her tail."
"She eats potions whole, glass and all."
"She reaches Tier 2 with the Concept Primal Storm of lightning, force and brutal melee."
"She bites with lightning, clads her tail in force and breathes a cone of lightning."
"She wears a saddle and lets a trusted rider sit on her back."
